:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Lollycat (Enemy)]].''
'''Panties Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 90 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Bermuda (Empire of Cats)|Bermuda]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] grants [[Area Attack]] and faster attack animation. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], they are unlocked from clearing [[Uranus (Cats of the Cosmos)|Uranus]] in chapter 3 and costs 19000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Panties Cat is unlocked once clearing [[Greece (Into the Future)|Greece]] in the [[Into the Future]] chapter and costs 45 Cat Food.

