==Talents==
''Accessible at level '''30'''''

*'''[[Slow]]''': Adds a 30% chance to slow [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies for 39f <sup>1.3s</sup>, improves by 9f <sup>0.3s</sup> per level up to 120f <sup>4s</sup> (Total Cost: 215 NP)
*'''[[Immune to Weaken]]''' (Cost: 75 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Freeze]]''': Reduces freeze duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Defense Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)

